/47502), decimals were added even when numbers were being rounded to whole integers beforehand. Additionally, the frame remainder is displayed as a timecode to the window title and console output.\r\n\r\nThis also fixes a floating-point division by zero that occurred when the movie was recorded in less than 1 second of real time.\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\n### Before\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_20250331_203211](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/61406411-eb02-4493-aca9-1fb6473e4755)\r\n\r\n```\r\n----------------\r\nDone recording movie at path: /tmp/out.avi\r\n5 frames at 60 FPS (movie length: 00.0:00.0:00.0), recorded in 00.0:00.0:00.0 (--9223372036854775808% of real-time speed).\r\nCPU time: 0.00 seconds (average: 0.37 ms/frame)\r\nGPU time: 0.00 seconds (average: 0.00 ms/frame)\r\n----------------\r\n```\r\n\r\n### After\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_20250331_203337](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8692d622-ccb1-4514-b935-0f39fa0b108c)\r\n\r\n```\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nDone recording movie at path: /tmp/out.avi\r\n5 frames at 60 FPS (movie length: 00:00:00:05), recorded in 00:00:00 (100% of real-time speed).\r\nCPU time: 0.00 seconds (average: 0.35 ms/frame)\r\nGPU time: 0.00 seconds (average: 0.00 ms/frame)\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n```\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core"